        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AK-A3, Bronze Drop Lever With Scalloped Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Drop Lever has a unique shape that elevates it into an elegant piece fit for almost any style home. When paired with the bronze Scalloped Rose, the set has faint rustic appearance that helps to add that often sought for warm and cozy feeling to any space. Made out of bronze, it is available in dark bronze, medium bronze, and antique pewter finishes. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/drop-sandcast-bronze-lever-fusion-ak\"><b>More Rose Choices</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Fusion AK Sandcast Broze Drop Lever With A3 Scalloped Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>True Bronze Product (Sandcast and Lost Wax) with over 90% Copper Content</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Rustic Door Lever Fusion AK:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length:  4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection:  2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height:  3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
